# =============================================================================
# CoupangEats2 — 올라가면 안 되는 것 (root .gitignore)
# =============================================================================

# ----- 블로그 문서 (로컬·블로그에만 둠, 레포 제외) -----
*.md

# ----- OS / IDE -----
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.cursor/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ----- Nested solo-repo backup (backend 기존 .git) -----
**/.git.upstream-backup/
**/.git.backup/

# ----- Node / 빌드 산출물 -----
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ----- 환경변수 · 시크릿 (example만 허용) -----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
**/dotenv/.env
**/dotenv/.env.*
!**/dotenv/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*credentials*
!*credentials*.md
!*credentials*.example*
*_accessKeys.csv
user*_accessKeys.csv
**/secrets/
.aws/
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519

# ----- Terraform (상태·플랜·로컬 플러그인) -----
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl.bak
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
tfplan-*
**/environments/**/tfplan*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
*.auto.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# ----- 로그 / 임시 -----
*.log
logs/
.tmp/
.temp/
tmp/
*.bak

# ----- Python / 기타 -----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pptx-venv/
